7,"Mixe, Quetzaltepec in Mexico Profile",https://m.joshuaproject.net/people_groups/print/14004/MX,"This system means that authority is communal rather than individual, and participation in public life is an expectation, not an option. The Quetzaltepec Mixe are known throughout Oaxaca for their vibrant brass bands; every community maintains one, and these ensembles perform at local festivals ...","Mixe, Quetzaltepec",Mixe-Zoquean
